  "summary": {
    "text": "o1-mini is a smaller, lower-cost OpenAI reasoning model released on 12 September 2024 together with o1-preview and aimed at STEM tasks, especially math and coding. It was offered to API usage tier 5 developers and in paid ChatGPT plans; OpenAI says its knowledge of non-STEM facts is comparable to small models like GPT-4o mini.",
